Original commit body from ddccf88:

Forgejo reads templates from .gitea/, not .forgejo/. The .forgejo
directory was created by mistake during initial implementation.

This commit tests the SQUASH_TEMPLATE.md functionality now that
the template exists on the dev branch. If this body appears in the
final squash merge commit, the template is working correctly.

Previous PRs couldn't use the template because it wasn't on the
base branch (dev) yet - each PR added the template, but it only
became available after that PR merged.
